purpose: Business logic, API integrations, and data management
common_tasks:
  - Adding new service methods
  - Implementing storage backends
  - Integrating with AT Protocol APIs
  - Managing data persistence
  - Handling authentication flows
  - Implementing caching strategies
watch_out_for:
  - Always test with BOTH storage types (local and AT Protocol)
  - Handle 400 errors gracefully (record might not exist)
  - Service wrappers handle initialization
  - Services should be storage-agnostic
  - Maintain singleton pattern where appropriate
  - Clean up event listeners
related_files:
  - /src/services/storage/* (storage backends)
  - /src/services/atproto/* (AT Protocol integration)
  - /src/types/* (service interfaces)
  - /src/hooks/* (hooks that use services)
test_command: npm run test:unit
key_patterns:
  - Wrapper → Service → Backend architecture
  - Async initialization pattern
  - Event emitter for real-time updates
  - Error recovery with retries
  - Proper TypeScript typing